WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(audience cheers)

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.950
- Since you were here a couple months ago,

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:03.480
you got an Oscar nomination.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.426
We knew it was gonna happen.

00:00:04.426 --> 00:00:05.739
(audience cheers)

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:08.880
Everyone knew it was gonna happen.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.110
How did you find out?

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.430
That's really cool news.

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:12.930
- Watching the broadcast at home.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.730
- Really?
- In the morning,

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.370
there was a knock at
the door of my bedroom,

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.810
and my kids were there with balloons

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.820
and they had a Carvel ice cream cake.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.230
- Oh my God, I will cry right now.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.490
That's so sweet.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:24.873
- It was Fudgy the Whale.

00:00:25.836 --> 00:00:28.980
- Aww, ice cream cakes are good.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:30.390
- Oh yes.
- Yeah.

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:31.680
- Enjoyed that one.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.570
And now it's a core memory of mine.

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:35.070
- I love that, I love it.

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:36.720
Are you getting prepared for a speech?

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.180
Do you prepare speeches or do
you, are you superstitious?

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:42.660
- Ooh, fail to prepare, prepare to fail.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.760
- Oh, well, I'm the first one.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.800
- I'm gonna put something, I'm
gonna put something in mind.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.430
Keep it behind glass with
a little hammer on it,

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:51.670
in case of emergency.

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:52.503
- [Kelly] And you boop boop.

00:00:52.503 --> 00:00:53.629
- And then I'll be able to
thank all the nice people.

00:00:53.629 --> 00:00:54.750
- [Kelly] Okay, I like this.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.400
- Help get me where I need to be.

